179    * @throws -20002 The given config_value is not supported. Empty or only spaces.
180    * @throws -20003 The given config_type is not supported. Only CHAR or NUMBER supported.
181    * @throws -20004 The given config_value exceeds the maximum length allowed.
182    * @throws -20005 The given config_value cannot be converted to a number.
