305    /** FUNCTION otap_util.build_msg
306    * Builds a message from a template identifier. Fetches the template and fills the given
307    * variables in p_param1-5 with the given value, if the parameters are filled. Type has
308    * special translation handling for filling the @type@ variable, if it exists in the template and
309    * type label is not NULL. Must be a label from otap_identifiers view like LABEL_COLUMN or LABEL_TABLE.
310    *
311    * Leaving all parameters apart from p_cfg_template empty will return just the current translation of
312    * a config or label value, according to OTAP_TRANSLATE or the default.
313    *
314    * Parameters must contain leading and trailing @ variable indicator. Ignored if not a otap variable
315    * in style @varname@.
316    *
317    * @param p_cfg_template The config name of the template. See otap_util.CFG_ constants.
318    * @param p_type_label The label name of the @type@ variable, if needed. See otap_util.CFG_LABEL constants.
319    * @param p_param1 The 1st variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
320    * @param p_param1_value The substitution value for the 1st variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
321    * @param p_param2 The 2nd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
322    * @param p_param2_value The substitution value for the 2nd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
323    * @param p_param3 The 3rd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
324    * @param p_param3_value The substitution value for the 3rd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
325    * @param p_param4 The 4th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
326    * @param p_param4_value The substitution value for the 4th variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
327    * @param p_param5 The 5th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
328    * @param p_param5_value The substitution value for the 5th variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
329    * @param p_param6n The 6th variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional. Supports NULL values.
330    * @param p_param6n_value The substitution value for the 6th variable name. Optional. Supports NULL values.
331    * @param p_description A template overwrite. Will return the given description instead of the template. Optional.
332    *
333    * @return The message build from template, overwritten by description or an error message.
334    */
335    FUNCTION build_msg( p_cfg_template  IN VARCHAR2
336  			 , p_type_label    IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
337  			 , p_param1	   IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
338  			 , p_param1_value  IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
339  			 , p_param2	   IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
340  			 , p_param2_value  IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
