120    * for test set, group and name. When a test session is finished, the test session view will not
121    * longer show the tests from the old session. If intended count is set, a test record about
122    * executed and expected tests is written.
123    *
124    * @param p_write_count_rec The indicator, if record count test should be done and written. Either otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TRUE or otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_FALSE.
125    * @param o_otap_session The current session_record from OTAP_TEST package.
126    *
127    * @return A summary of the old session and details of the new session as text message LF delimited.
128    *
129    * @exception -20099 Internal error, invalid OTAP_SESSION object.
130    */
131    FUNCTION finish_test( p_write_count_rec IN	     NUMBER
132  			   , o_otap_session    IN OUT NOCOPY OTAP_SESSION
133  			   )
134  	 RETURN VARCHAR2
